%p
  Tonight's run could not expire the one-time memberships below. They are past
  their expiry date but still Active, so they can still be used to book. Fix
  each record (usually a validation error from old data); the job retries
  them every night.
%ul
  - @failures.each do |failure|
    %li
      = link_to failure[:member_code].presence || "Membership #{failure[:id]}", admin_membership_url(failure[:id])
      = "(expired #{failure[:expires_on]&.to_formatted_s(:long)}):"
      = failure[:error]
